ration","name":"QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.HasMarkovGnsEmbedding.repr","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.lean#L64-L64","doc":"**The GNS representation** as a function `A → (H → H)`\n(left multiplication on the GNS quotient, extended to H by\ncontinuity). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.HasMarkovGnsEmbedding.trM_faithful","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.HasMarkovGnsEmbedding.trM_faithful","kind":"theorem","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.lean#L60-L60","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.HasMarkovGnsEmbedding.traceIdeal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.HasMarkovGnsEmbedding.traceIdeal","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.lean#L59-L59","doc":"**Faithfulness on the GNS quotient**:\n`tr_M(x* x) = 0 → x ∈ trace ideal`. Encoded via an explicit\nideal predicate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.HasMarkovGnsEmbedding.trM_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.HasMarkovGnsEmbedding.trM_pos","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.lean#L55-L55","doc":"**Positivity** (every real `q > 0` under convention D): `tr_M(x* x) ≥ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.HasMarkovGnsEmbedding.trM_cyclic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.HasMarkovGnsEmbedding.trM_cyclic","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.lean#L53-L53","doc":"**Traciality** (cyclicity): `tr_M(x · y) = tr_M(y · x)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.HasMarkovGnsEmbedding.trM_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.HasMarkovGnsEmbedding.trM_add","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.lean#L51-L51","doc":"**Linearity** of `trM`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.HasMarkovGnsEmbedding.trM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.HasMarkovGnsEmbedding.trM","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.lean#L49-L49","doc":"The (real-valued) Markov trace. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.HasMarkovGnsEmbedding.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.HasMarkovGnsEmbedding.mk","kind":"ctor","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.lean#L45-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.HasMarkovGnsEmbedding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Observations.AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.HasMarkovGnsEmbedding","kind":"class","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Observations/AlgebraicGnsEmbedding.lean#L37-L73","doc":"**Markov-trace GNS embedding data.**\n\nA class witnessing the Jones–Wenzl GNS embedding of the inductive\nlimit Hecke algebra `H_∞(q)` into bounded operators on a Hilbert\nspace. Each field carries concrete content; no `True` placeholders.\n\nThe carrier `A` represents `H_∞(q)`, the carrier `H` represents the\nGNS Hilbert space, and `repr` is the faithful representation. ","signatureChunk":0}]}